Open ouy file with you favourite audio manipulation program.
Open the files that contain voice data.
Find the option EQ, or Equalizer or something like that(in Sond Forge 6.1 is Process->EQ->Graphic). 
Then you should have an equalizer similar to winamp's. 
Leave the slider "80Hz" and pull down a bit the slider to the left of "80Hz" Keep doing this with all the sliders to the left each time lowering a bit more. Then accept the changes and save the file.
